{
    "title": "Dollar General-Digital Coupons",
    "description": "Download the DG Android App and join myDG\u00ae to earn deals, rewards and bonuses! Explore all the benefits of myDG\u00ae for additional savings today. Shop in the app and find everything that you need at the lowest prices!\r\n\r\n. myDG\u00ae Wallet \u2013 See your exclusive offers, filter and search your clipped Coupons and Cash Back, access your myDG\u00ae ID, scan DG Cash to spend in store, and more.\r\n\r\n. Digital Coupons \u2013 Save on hundreds of items every week.\r\n\r\n. Cart Calculator \u2013 In-store budgeting that helps you save as you shop.\r\n\r\n. Shopping List \u2013 Keep your checklist and add coupons to your myDG\u00ae Wallet.\r\n\r\n. Weekly Ads \u2013 See what\u2019s on sale at your store.\r\n\r\nYour favorite ways to save - All in one place! Shop the Dollar General app to plan your next shopping trip, or order online.\r\n\r\nOur stores are full of great stuff! You will never know what you might find, but our stores always include:\r\n\r\nGroceries:\r\n- Food\r\n- Drinks\r\n- Milk\r\n- Eggs\r\n- Soda\r\n- Pantry\r\n- Coffee\r\n- Tea\r\n\r\nParty Supplies:\r\n- Holiday Decorations\r\n- Paper Plates & Cups\r\n- Plastic Forks & Knives\r\n- Festive Paper Napkins\r\n- Balloons\r\n\r\nCleaning Supplies:\r\n- Paper Towels\r\n- Sponges & Scrubbers\r\n- Mops & Brooms\r\n- Window & Floor Cleaning\r\n\r\nSchool & Office Supplies:\r\n- Pens & Pencils\r\n- Folders & Filing\r\n- Paper & Notebooks\r\n- Backpacks & Lunch Boxes\r\n\r\nPet Supplies:\r\n- Cat & Dog Food\r\n- Cat & Dog Toys\r\n\r\nHome & Garden:\r\n- Pots & Planters\r\n- Lawn Decorations\r\n- Home Decor\r\n- Pillows\r\n- Candles\r\n- Rugs & Mats\r\n- Blankets & Throws\r\n\r\nFind the Dollar General App in the Google Play Store, log in and start shopping and saving today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the DG Android App and join myDG\u00ae to earn deals, rewards and bonuses! Explore all the benefits of myDG\u00ae for additional savings today. Shop in the app and find everything that you need at the lowest prices!<br><br>. myDG\u00ae Wallet \u2013 See your exclusive offers, filter and search your clipped Coupons and Cash Back, access your myDG\u00ae ID, scan DG Cash to spend in store, and more.<br><br>. Digital Coupons \u2013 Save on hundreds of items every week.<br><br>. Cart Calculator \u2013 In-store budgeting that helps you save as you shop.<br><br>. Shopping List \u2013 Keep your checklist and add coupons to your myDG\u00ae Wallet.<br><br>. Weekly Ads \u2013 See what\u2019s on sale at your store.<br><br>Your favorite ways to save - All in one place! Shop the Dollar General app to plan your next shopping trip, or order online.<br><br>Our stores are full of great stuff! You will never know what you might find, but our stores always include:<br><br>Groceries:<br>- Food<br>- Drinks<br>- Milk<br>- Eggs<br>- Soda<br>- Pantry<br>- Coffee<br>- Tea<br><br>Party Supplies:<br>- Holiday Decorations<br>- Paper Plates &amp; Cups<br>- Plastic Forks &amp; Knives<br>- Festive Paper Napkins<br>- Balloons<br><br>Cleaning Supplies:<br>- Paper Towels<br>- Sponges &amp; Scrubbers<br>- Mops &amp; Brooms<br>- Window &amp; Floor Cleaning<br><br>School &amp; Office Supplies:<br>- Pens &amp; Pencils<br>- Folders &amp; Filing<br>- Paper &amp; Notebooks<br>- Backpacks &amp; Lunch Boxes<br><br>Pet Supplies:<br>- Cat &amp; Dog Food<br>- Cat &amp; Dog Toys<br><br>Home &amp; Garden:<br>- Pots &amp; Planters<br>- Lawn Decorations<br>- Home Decor<br>- Pillows<br>- Candles<br>- Rugs &amp; Mats<br>- Blankets &amp; Throws<br><br>Find the Dollar General App in the Google Play Store, log in and start shopping and saving today!",
